NOTICE — third-party data included in this repository

The MIT license above covers the source code of this project. It does NOT
grant rights to third-party data bundled for reproducibility:

  data/market/*.csv
      US equity daily bars retrieved from Alpha Vantage
      (https://www.alphavantage.co, TIME_SERIES_DAILY).
      Included solely so that demos, backtests and judging can replay the exact
      same price series offline. This is not a redistribution offering: the
      files are provided for demonstration and evaluation of this project only,
      and remain subject to Alpha Vantage's own terms of service. Anyone
      wanting this data for another purpose should obtain it from the source
      (a free API key works — see scripts/fetch_market_data.py).

No production funds are involved anywhere in this project: it runs on Solana
localnet and devnet only, and the tokenized equities it trades are test mints
created by scripts/setup_devnet.py because no tokenized equity exists on devnet.
Nothing here is investment advice or an offer of any financial service.
